  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>2240</x>
      <y>470</y>
      <w>560</w>
      <h>118</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Weekly update (Namita): every Friday 12:00 AM the Timer calls
ReportController.runWeeklyReports(), then startNewWeek(), which
moves this week's services to records_archive.txt. The time of the
last run is kept in weekly_update.txt, so a missed Friday is caught up.
bg=#FFFBE0</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>2250</x>
      <y>2750</y>
      <w>520</w>
      <h>100</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Every Report subclass takes the ChocAnDatabase in its
constructor, to look up provider and member names.
SummaryReport and EFTReport only cover providers that
are still in the system.
bg=#FFFBE0</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>400</x>
      <y>2790</y>
      <w>700</w>
      <h>84</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>AppFolders finds the one folder that holds data/, reports/ and
ProviderDirectory/ (used by ChocAnDatabase, ProviderDirectory,
Report, AcmeInterface and Timer). SampleData writes the sample files.
bg=#FFFBE0</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
